====== NETGEAR R7000 Nighthawk ======

{{section>meta:infobox:broadcom_wifi#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The Netgear R7000 "Nighthawk" is a Broadcom 802.11ac AC1900 router with storage sharing USB 2.0 & 3.0 ports.

